<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Check the appropriate box:</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9744;&#160; &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; Preliminary Proxy Statement</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9744; &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Confidential, for Use of the Commission Only (as permitted by Rule 14a-6(e)(2))</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9746; &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Definitive Proxy Statement</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9744; &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Definitive Additional Materials</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#9744; &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Soliciting Material Pursuant to Section 240.14a-11(c) or Section 240.14a-12</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 16pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="dei:EntityRegistrantName" id="c4">Aemetis, Inc.</ix:nonNumeric></b></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><i>(Name of Registrant as Specified in its Charter)</i></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

