			</td>
			<td style="width: 28%;" valign="top">
			<p style="margin: 0px 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">Very truly yours,<span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 12%;" valign="top">
			<p style="margin: 0px 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>
			</td>
