<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1) </sup>"Stock Awards" listed above are in the form of Common Stock with immediate vesting under the Aemetis, Inc. Amended and Restated 2019 Stock Plan.</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>

