<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(1) </sup>The shares in the column labeled as "Unexercisable" are granted but not yet vested as of December 31, 2025. For each separate option grant, one-twelfth (1/12) of the shares subject to the option grant vest every three months following the date of grant.</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Option Exercises and Stock Vested</b></p>

