</div>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Our Chief Executive Officer (&#8220;CEO&#8221;), <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2021-01-01_2025-12-31" name="ecd:PeoName" id="c45">Eric A. McAfee</ix:nonNumeric>, served as our Principal Executive Officer (&#8220;PEO&#8221;) during 2021 to 2025. The compensation for our other Named Executive Officers (&#8220;Non-PEO NEOs&#8221;) is the average of compensation of Non-PEO NEOs who were employed during all twelve months of the applicable year.</p>
</ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>

<div>&#160;</div>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="ecd:AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock" id="c46" escape="true">
