<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">For purpose of calculating the "Actually Paid" compensation, the value of stock options as of the end of a calendar year or as of a vesting date is based on a Black-Scholes valuation model using the following assumptions, expressed as a range over the applicable calendar year:</p>

