<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" name="ecd:CompActuallyPaidVsTotalShareholderRtnTextBlock" id="c79" escape="true">
<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left"><b>Pay Versus Performance Relationship</b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">The following charts show the relationship between the amounts included in the Pay versus Performance Table for each year from 2021 to 2025, including a comparison of Compensation Actually Paid to the CEO and the average Compensation Actually Paid to our non-CEO NEOs, and each of the two performance measures set forth the Pay versus Performance Table.</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>

